    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "replace.rs has one test module named tests. Add the new test function at the end of that module, before its closing brace. Do not write a second mod tests. Keep replace_all pub(crate). Skip a hit whose old text is empty. Combine that skip with the old-equals-new skip by one || condition, and continue once. Do not write two continue arms.  Do not write two if arms that return the same value. Combine them with ||. That is clippy::if_same_then_else. Do not touch pattern_is_empty or keep_disjoint. The existing tests an_empty_pattern_inserts_nothing and a_same_replacement_inserts_nothing stay green. Do not rewrite their assertions. The test an_empty_match_inserts_nothing uses a regex pattern a star and the replacement x. On the text b the count is 0 and the transaction is empty. On the text a the count is 1. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep the change under about 60 lines. Stay inside this one behavior. Run the full test module named in the commands, not only the new test."
  },
